Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.49,0:00:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want her, you'll have to use\Nyour dual blades to take her from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can defeat me in combat,\Nyou'll be free to take Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, if you lose, you\Nwill join the Knights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to settle this\Nwith swords, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have ourselves a duel then.
