Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you agree to a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, calm down. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.69,0:00:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you gave\Nme any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other day, when you used\Nyour duel wielding skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, the commander has\Nhis own unique skill, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen it a bunch\Nof times myself. The divine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blade it maximizes his\Noffensive and defensive moves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:01:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his attack is strong but\Nhis defense is incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's ever seen the\Ncommander's HP bar drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the yellow zone before\Nhis invincibility is way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beyond the normal game balance\NI know what if you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I don't get\Nmy leave of absence I care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about you having to join the\NKnights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not planning on losing easily.
