Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think this\Nwould be such a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can get a cut of the tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when we're finished, you'll become\Nan official member of the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll consider this your first mission.
