Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shield?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your reaction time is very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and your defense is impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber. Rubber. Rubber!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.58,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(964.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H151714&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}October {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}      {\fscx105}50{\fscx95}th Floor • Algade
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.58,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(963,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}October {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}      {\fscx105}50{\fscx95}th Floor • Algade
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't you guys have\Nuniforms that aren't so flashy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's one of\Nour less flashy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's sort of my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a good opportunity\Nas a solo player.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got as far as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you avoid guilds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind my asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not because you're a beta tester or\Nbecause you have unique skills, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do care about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago,\Nabout a year or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up to now, that was the\Nonly guild I was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was small, including me;\Nthere were six of us in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They called themselves\Nthe Moonlit Black Cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As players, they were good, but their\Nlevels were way lower than mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I thought if I told them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what my level was, they\Nwouldn't have wanted me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided to keep my mouth shut about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it, and I joined up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:07:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd watch them, messing around,\Nhaving fun, and I guess I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be part of that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reason
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guild was wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't hidden the\Nfact that I was a beater,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have convinced them how\Ndangerous that trap really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die, got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die because...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to protect you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,450)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(981,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H1F1F22&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}October {\fscx110}23{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}     {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,450)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(981,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H1F1F22&\blur3\fs72\alpha&45}October {\fscx110}23{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}     {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,450)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(979.5,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}October {\fscx110}23{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}     {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, me, and one other guy\Nare going to form a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we're all going to go\Nclear the dungeon on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Godfrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito and I are already in...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything about it, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, as second-in-command, you\Nknow we can't ignore the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's going to be joining us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it's my job as\Ncommander of the front lines
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to take the kid out and\Nevaluate his skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.07,0:08:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, in 30 minutes, I want to\Nsee you at the Western Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoorah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally had a chance to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:08:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're waiting for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all on the same guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I figured now's a good time as\Nany for you guys to bury the hatchet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the other day, I apologize for\Nmy behavior. I was rude to you and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i i promise it won't happen again\Nyeah sure all right ladies time to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,focus today i'll be checking out how\Nyou react to dangerous situations
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i'm gonna need you to hand over\Nall the crystals in your storage
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my Teleport Crystals? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go clear a dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.11,0:10:22.11,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fscx90\fscy85\blur3\yshad3.75\1a&HFE\4a&H22\pos(960,937.5)}55th Floor • Near the Labyrinth
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.11,0:10:22.11,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\alpha&H11&\fscx90\fscy85\blur0.6\shad0\c&HFBFEFF&\pos(960,937.5)}55th Floor • Near the Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like a good\Nplace to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ciao time, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You packed the water cura deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Antidote crystals, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor, sad old Godfrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew you were a colossal idiot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this proves you're\Neven dumber than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our party was walking along when...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were attacked by this gang of criminal\Nplayers who appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You both fought hard, but\Nyou were killed in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just me against all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And somehow, I courageously and\Nsingle-handedly fought them all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I just killed an\Ninnocent bystander because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:12:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I going to live with myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From over here, you look like\Nyou're having a blast doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would a guy like you\Njoin the Knights of the Blood Oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be more at home with\None of the criminal guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an interesting observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have sharp eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're with Leafa and Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The murder guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I got the skills\Nto paralyze bastards like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better stop talking or\Nthe poison will wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we wouldn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to finish you off for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison's not wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know how it feels knowing\Nyou're about to die like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your tongue paralyzed too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this where I'm going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your last chance to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep struggling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of dying after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was tracking your position\Non the map the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I saw Godfrey disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got worried something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not dreaming, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, I can explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just training when all\Nof a sudden there was this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up. I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never see me again, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oldest trick in the book,\Nand you fell for it, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddamn you, you murdered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was all my fault, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should stay away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, my life belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise, I'll do anything\Nto protect you two. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can to make\Nsure you get back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, could I stay\Nwith you for the night?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H061926&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx100}61{\fscx95}st Floor • Selmburg
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H020A11&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H45\fscx100}61{\fscx95}st Floor • Selmburg
Dialogue: 2,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx110}61{\fscx95}st Floor • Selmburg
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get undressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was to spend the\Nnight with you tonight and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the, uh, the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, you, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just having a\Ndream about my old life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the dream I had,\Neverything in Aincrad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything that happened in\Nmeeting you was just that, a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, I don't want my\Nlife here to disappear is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last two years have\Nbeen very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, maybe we could leave\Nthe front lines for a while. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like if we return to the battlefield\Nnow, something bad's gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm just tired of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the southwest of Floor 22,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's this tiny little\Nvillage by a lake and a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we could get a\Nhouse together, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.39,0:21:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
